#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: pronamic-pay-with-rabo-smart-pay.php:3
msgid "Pronamic Pay with Rabo Smart Pay"
msgstr "Pronamic Pay with Rabo Smart Pay"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: pronamic-pay-with-rabo-smart-pay.php:4
msgid "https://www.pronamic.eu/plugins/pronamic-pay-with-rabo-smart-pay/"
msgstr "https://www.pronamic.eu/plugins/pronamic-pay-with-rabo-smart-pay/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: pronamic-pay-with-rabo-smart-pay.php:5
msgid ""
"Accept payments in WordPress via Rabo Smart Pay (formerly Rabo OmniKassa "
"2.0) with the Pronamic Pay payment processing library."
msgstr ""
"Accepteer betalingen in WordPress via Rabo Smart Pay (voorheen Rabo "
"OmniKassa 2.0) met de Pronamic Pay betaalverwerkingsbibliotheek."

#. Author of the plugin
#: pronamic-pay-with-rabo-smart-pay.php:11
msgid "Pronamic"
msgstr "Pronamic"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: pronamic-pay-with-rabo-smart-pay.php:12
msgid "https://www.pronamic.eu/"
msgstr "https://www.pronamic.nl/"

#. translators: %s: item index
#: src/Gateway.php:272
#, php-format
msgid "Item %s"
msgstr "Item %s"

#: src/Gateway.php:360
msgid ""
"Cannot refund: the payment has no Rabo Smart Pay transaction ID. The Rabo "
"Smart Pay webhook may not have been processed for this payment."
msgstr ""
"Kan niet terugbetalen: de betaling heeft geen Rabo Smart Pay-transactie-ID. "
"De Rabo Smart Pay-webhook is mogelijk niet verwerkt voor deze betaling."

#: src/Gateway.php:369
msgid ""
"Cannot refund: the payment transaction ID is a Rabo Smart Pay order ID "
"instead of a transaction ID. The Rabo Smart Pay webhook may not have been "
"processed for this payment."
msgstr ""
"Kan niet terugbetalen: het transactie-ID van de betaling is een Rabo Smart "
"Pay-order-ID in plaats van een transactie-ID. De Rabo Smart Pay-webhook is "
"mogelijk niet verwerkt voor deze betaling."

